    Fix hint, scoring, input and restart bugs; move logic to logic_utils
    
    - Fix backwards hints: swap the Too High/Too Low messages and compare
      guess and secret as ints (app.py turned the secret into a string on
      even attempts, so "100" < "50")
    - Move check_guess, parse_guess, get_range_for_difficulty and
      update_score from app.py into logic_utils.py
    - Reject non-integer and out-of-range guesses without using an attempt
    - Make Hard (1-200) wider than Normal (1-100)
    - Scoring: first-guess win earns 100, every wrong guess costs 5, and the
      score can't go below 0
    - Fix New Game: reset_game() resets secret, attempts, score, status and
      history; also start a new game when the difficulty changes
    - Show the difficulty's real range in the prompt
    - Add regression tests for each fix and pytest.ini so tests can import
      logic_utils from the repo root
    - Fill in reflection sections 2 and 3
